serve.json
cli
# The docs site (/docs) is built on Vercel from docs-site/ (see vercel.json buildCommand).
# Re-include its sources, which the rules above (*.md, package.json) would drop, and the
# CHANGELOG.md its changelog page imports. build-vercel.mjs keeps them out of the served site.
!docs-site/**
!CHANGELOG.md
docs-site/node_modules
docs-site/dist
docs-site/.astro
/dist
